\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The frontier. (a) Refusal recovered against benign over-refusal: the $2\,\%$ repair reaches the aligned model's refusal rate with 10 points less over-refusal than the global repair. (b) The same recovery against GSM8K: the $2\,\%$ repair keeps roughly half of the capability the global repair loses, and the paired interval on that difference excludes zero. Generated from the published tables by \texttt  {\small  report/make\_report\_data.py}.}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
